sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant UI as Admin calendar toolbar
    participant API as Existing AdminOrderController
    participant Query as OrderQueryService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    Admin->>UI: Select start/end calendar days
    UI->>UI: Validate; convert local midnight to explicit Instants
    UI->>API: GET /api/orders?createdFrom&createdBefore&status&orderId&page
    Note over API: Existing Firebase ADMIN authorization
    API->>Query: Bound optional filters
    Query->>Query: Validate range and ID length
    Query->>DB: Combined conditional WHERE, ORDER, LIMIT/OFFSET and count
    DB-->>UI: Filtered page and totals
    Admin->>UI: Refresh icon
    UI->>UI: Clear stale row selection, retain criteria
    UI->>API: Repeat same filtered query
